    "description": "Define a material, and optionally assign it to elements. Without 'elements' it returns a material for TektonTranslate, which then applies to the whole model. Wire beams or plates into 'elements' and the grade is written onto them instead, so one model can mix C24 joists, GL24h beams and CLT plates - the translator gives each grade its own material and its own sections. Single properties can be overridden; an overridden or unknown grade is marked as an assumption wherever it shows up.",
